    "body": "Stopped at Step 7. Claim released.\n\nThe new test reproduces the bug on upstream/main 780b0a25.\nTest: the_machine_page_buttons_fit_without_scrolling_at_720_px.\nThe Load other rectangle spans y=644 to y=668, but its text does not paint there.\nThe fix limits the overview height and keeps the action row visible.\nThe test passes with the fix.\nThe mutation check fails with the old layout and passes after restoration.\nNo G-code or golden files change.\n\nThe quick gate fails twice on ai_chat::safety::post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch.\nHarness::run reaches max_steps=4 during a scroll-area repaint.\nThat test passes alone.\nAll machine-page tests pass in the final gate.\nThe six selected integration suites also pass.\n\nClippy fails twice because MIN_LABEL_PX is unused at crates/ui/src/egui_app/painted.rs:115.\nThat constant is unchanged from upstream/main 780b0a25.\nI did not change the unrelated code.\n\nThe initial gate and Clippy commands stalled in the compiler cache wrapper.\nI interrupted those commands and retried with RUSTC_WRAPPER unset.\nI did not change the shared cache service.\n\nThe patch remains uncommitted in .claude/worktrees/issue-2105 on branch issue/2105-machine-buttons.\nThe patch contains the layout fix, its test, two expected overview-test updates, and the decision record.\nNo branch was pushed. No PR was opened.\nThe issue is free again.\n",
